105
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:27,240
Remember, your father's blood is in your veins as well.

106
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,780
Did you know my father?

107
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:30,680
Yes.

108
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:33,480
He's a legend among us.

109
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:36,660
And to all of those who continue fighting for their freedom.

110
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:37,260
Really?

111
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,000
