123
00:04:10,980 --> 00:04:11,980
Ow!

124
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:25,980
Our dream...

125
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:26,960
Was born here.

126
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:31,140
That's the entrance to the detention facilities.

127
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:34,640
Anti-entertainment forces keep their prisoners underground there.

128
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:39,040
This abandoned mine leads to the basement of the detention facility.

129
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:44,260
We'll attack from outside and create a diversion to draw the attention of the guards who are on duty.

130
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:47,420
While they're confused, you'll all enter through the basement.

131
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:48,540
Just be careful.

132
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,380
So this is a distraction tactic, then.

133
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:53,100
