Yuka, eat up!

203
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:25,540
Eat it!

204
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,540
Yeah, I'll eat later, okay?

205
00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:29,800
Look, you've got food on your face!

206
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,000
Thank you for waiting!

207
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,520
We should be safe here.

208
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,520
Yuka's family has always been good to Woda.

209
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,340
They make sure to take care of us.

210
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,960
They let us have as much rice as we want.

211
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:42,360
They'll even give us pork soup

212
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,440
instead of miso soup.

213
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,440
Good news!

214
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,480
Good news!

215
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,000
Because of the coating on your clothes,

216
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,400
