217
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,460
But I...

218
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:54,020
I can't go on stage looking like this.

219
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:56,860
I wanted to be up there with Yoko.

220
00:08:56,860 --> 00:09:00,280
I'm sure you'll have another chance.

221
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:05,380
Come on, you could have told me!

222
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,700
I still don't understand why you didn't bother

223
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:09,980
to tell me anything about Lancaster and your letters.

224
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,440
I'm so sorry, darling,

225
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,820
but we thought you would worry and didn't want to...

226
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:15,180
Sir, ma'am!

227
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:15,540
Huh?

228
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:17,820
Please tell me.

229
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:22,320
Is it my fault my father was taken to the detention facility?

230
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:23,280
Just tell me!

231
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,620
In the beginning,

232
00:09:31,900 --> 00:09:34,660
