233
00:09:34,660 --> 00:09:36,580
They didn't fall for it.

234
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,320
Your father was told to make you quit.

235
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,200
It's not your fault.

236
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,780
Motomiya-san was stubborn.

237
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,300
And he refused.

238
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:46,440
Huh?

239
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:57,180
We're almost at your house, Nagisa.

240
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:58,800
Yeah.

241
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,720
Do you want to go see your mom?

242
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:04,100
It's okay.

243
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,460
I'd just cause her trouble

244
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:08,280
