245
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:10,880
Mom...

246
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:17,260
She always took such good care of them.

247
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:23,600
I can't get a nice color

248
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,760
because of all the smoke from the factories.

249
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,100
You should get some flowers

250
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:29,460
that are easier to grow.

251
00:10:29,780 --> 00:10:31,560
The added effort makes them precious.

252
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:33,680
Just like you, Nagisa.

253
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:34,440
I'm sorry.

254
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:38,560
I'm sorry.

255
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:40,980
Because of me.

256
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:43,120
Dad and Mom are...

257
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:45,080
I'm sorry.

258
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,180
I'm sorry.

259
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:52,280
Take Megumi to the infirmary.

260
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:54,700
The rest of you get to your lessons immediately.

261
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:55,800
There's no time.

262
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:56,800
Okay.

263
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,540
Let's start with Nagisa on Cherry.

264
00:10:58,540 --> 00:10:59,040
Okay.

265
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:19,080
Cherry, Cherry boy.

266
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,680
Cherry, Cherry boy.

267
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,680
Cherry, Cherry boy.

268
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,600
Oh, oh.

269
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:27,600
Nagisa?

270
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,020
Nagisa, what's wrong?

271
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,680
It must be psychological.

272
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:45,340
It's happened before.

273
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:46,760
A tremendous amount of stress

274
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,280
can make someone lose their voice.

275
00:11:48,660 --> 00:11:49,240
But...

276
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,580
The concert is tomorrow.

277
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:52,700
There's no time.

278
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:53,860
We can do something

279
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:55,100
about all of the other songs

280
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:56,160
on the set list

281
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:58,660
by assigning Nagisa's part

282
00:11:58,660 --> 00:11:59,720
to someone else.

283
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:01,180
But it won't work

284
00:12:01,180 --> 00:12:02,300
for Nagisa no Cherry.

285
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,800
Let me sing it, Tsubasa-san.

286
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:06,140
Cherry?

287
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,380
I've been practicing with her

288
00:12:08,380 --> 00:12:09,320
this whole time.

289
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:10,580
I have the lyrics

290
00:12:10,580 --> 00:12:12,720
and the solo choreography memorized.

291
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:13,920
Hey, Chiri.

292
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:15,240
Do you think you can?

293
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:15,940
Yes.

294
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:17,220
Please let me do it.

295
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,340
Hmm, fine then.

296
00:12:22,260 --> 00:12:24,620
